# Vunesp Prep Monorepo Conventions

- Apps live in `apps/<name>/`; packages in `packages/<name>/`, named `@vunesp/<name>`
- TypeScript strict; named exports; no `any` without justification
- Cross-package imports use package names, not relative paths
- Shared configs: `@vunesp/typescript-config`, `@vunesp/eslint-config`; Prettier at the repo root
- UI: shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4 in `@vunesp/ui`, consumed as source via `transpilePackages`
- Test runner: Vitest, colocated `*.test.ts(x)`
- See `.claude/rules/monorepo.md` for how to add a package
